  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.22.0: Loam.Charts gains two chart controls on the shared ChartBase — RadialGauge (a single value as a filled arc with an optional center readout; Value/Minimum/Maximum, StartAngle/SweepAngle/Thickness, Format/CenterText/Caption) and Sparkline (a compact inline line/bar strip via Mode, chrome and tooltip off by default). Both inherit the theme palette, hover/click, and empty state, and expose their value to assistive technology. Adds Charts.GaugeFraction. Additive. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
